  "content": "Vendor strategy: Voyage (voyage-code-3, dim 1024) is the default embedder; MCP sampling is the default reasoning path with direct Anthropic/OpenAI as fallback. Ollama and fastembed paths were deleted on 2026-05-26 - they added too much install friction for the open-source \"30 seconds to try\" pitch. Sampling lets users with Claude Pro / ChatGPT Plus subscriptions pay for reasoning through their existing client (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor) - no extra API key needed. Background dreaming still needs a direct reasoner because there's no client session for sampling. Don't reintroduce Ollama/fastembed without a clear case.",
